			"notes": "# 1.3.0 重大更新：纵享丝滑\n\n- 关闭聊天栏时添加全新消息渐隐动画，消息会向下移动的同时透明度渐变为0\n- Fabric端添加从Modmenu菜单打开配置屏幕的支持\n- Neoforge端添加从模组页面打开配置屏幕的支持\n- 优化聊天栏关闭动画，现在使用打开聊天栏动画的倒放版\n- 现在可以设定动画时长，添加消息发送动画时长和聊天栏动画时长全新配置项\n- 润色并改进翻译，修改模组描述\n- 支持1.21.5，升级开发时的依赖\n- 改进并清理大量代码\n\n\n# 1.3.0 Major Update: Smooth as Silk\n\n- Added a new message fade-out animation when closing the chat bar, messages will move downward while their opacity gradually fades to 0.\n- Fabric: Added support for opening the configuration screen from the Modmenu.\n- Neoforge: Added support for opening the configuration screen from the mods list.\n- Optimized the chat bar closing animation: Now uses the reverse version of the chat bar opening animation.\n- Customizable animation durations: Added new configuration options for message sending animation duration and chat bar animation duration.\n- Polished and improved translations, updated mod descriptions.\n- Added support for 1.21.5 and upgraded development dependencies.\n- Improved and cleaned up code.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a729a0d4-3360-43d5-be2f-9edc736a5496"
		}
